@startuml
title Figure 6: Full System Administrator Sequence Diagram

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "System\nAdministrator" as Admin
participant "Frontend" as UI
participant "Backend\nAPI" as API
participant "Auth\nService" as Auth
participant "User\nService" as UserSvc
participant "Department\nService" as DeptSvc
participant "Report\nService" as ReportSvc
database "Database" as DB
participant "Email\nService" as Email

== Authentication ==
Admin -> UI: Enter Credentials
UI -> API: POST /api/auth/login
API -> Auth: validateCredentials()
Auth -> DB: findByEmail()
DB --> Auth: User (role=ADMIN)
Auth -> Auth: verifyPassword(BCrypt)
Auth -> Auth: generateJWT()
Auth --> API: JWT Token
API --> UI: {token, user}
UI --> Admin: Redirect to Dashboard

== User Management ==
Admin -> UI: Create User Form
UI -> API: POST /api/users/create
API -> UserSvc: createUser(dto)
UserSvc -> UserSvc: generatePassword()
UserSvc -> UserSvc: hashPassword()
UserSvc -> DB: INSERT user
DB --> UserSvc: User Created
UserSvc -> Email: sendWelcomeEmail()
Email --> UserSvc: Email Sent
UserSvc -> DB: INSERT audit_log
UserSvc --> API: UserResponse
API --> UI: Success
UI --> Admin: User Created

== Department Management ==
Admin -> UI: Create Department
UI -> API: POST /api/departments
API -> DeptSvc: createDepartment(dto)
DeptSvc -> DB: INSERT department
DB --> DeptSvc: Department Created
DeptSvc -> DB: INSERT audit_log
DeptSvc --> API: DepartmentResponse
API --> UI: Success
UI --> Admin: Department Created

== View All Issues ==
Admin -> UI: View Issues
UI -> API: GET /api/issues/all
API -> DB: SELECT * FROM issues
DB --> API: All Issues
API --> UI: IssueList[]
UI --> Admin: Display Issues Table

== Generate Reports ==
Admin -> UI: Generate Report
UI -> API: POST /api/reports/generate
API -> ReportSvc: generateReport(params)
ReportSvc -> DB: Query Statistics
DB --> ReportSvc: Aggregated Data
ReportSvc -> ReportSvc: createCharts()
ReportSvc -> ReportSvc: formatPDF()
ReportSvc --> API: Report File
API --> UI: Download Link
UI --> Admin: Download Report

== Audit Logs ==
Admin -> UI: View Audit Logs
UI -> API: GET /api/audit-logs
API -> DB: SELECT * FROM audit_logs
DB --> API: Audit Records
API --> UI: AuditLog[]
UI --> Admin: Display Audit Table

@enduml
